- Yeah, everything else is pretty good.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.336
- So is the poly couple
that you're with...

00:08:42.336 --> 00:08:43.169
- [Travis] Two girls?

00:08:43.169 --> 00:08:44.420
- a straight... or like two
girls or a man and a woman?

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:45.810
- So I have three relationships

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.940
but both my partners are bi.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.240
- Are you an ally, though?

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.440
(everyone cheers and laughs)

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.390
- With those nails.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.580
- [Zach] If you're questioning yourself,

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:59.255
allow yourself the space to explore

00:08:59.255 --> 00:09:02.730
and feel okay with not
knowing for a little bit.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.100
- I lost someone very
close to me a year ago

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:06.930
who was a young queer person.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:10.770
And I just want every
young queer person to know

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.820
that it gets better.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.980
And there will become a point in your life

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:15.450
where you are very confident

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.430
in being part of this beautiful community.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.260
- If you find the queer community,

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.020
you have a place in it immediately.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.700
You're immediately accepted into it.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.320
Take some time to think it over,

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:27.870
figure out if you're one
of us, and if you are,

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:30.720
congratulations, 'cause we're fantastic.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.340
- It's reparations from
the straight community.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.397
- It is reparations!
(everyone laughs)

00:09:34.397 --> 00:09:35.346
- Oh, yeah, right?

00:09:35.346 --> 00:09:36.742
- Happy Pride!
- Happy Pride!

00:09:36.742 --> 00:09:39.984
(everyone cheers and laughs)

